</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2002/09/19 (木) 16:58:24 <strong>▽</strong> <a href="mailto:neun@sings.jp">電波妖精</a> </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs@res_200209194165824_log_kirikiri.cgi">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200209194165824"></font>
